  "title": "RRC: Only create the global U-RNTI / C-RNTI map once",
  "description": "Since this is an auto resetting wmem tree, we can create it only\nonce at protocol registration, instead of creating it each time\na file is opened in rrc_init. It will automatically empty.\n\nWe could continue to create it in rrc_init, but would need to\ndestroy the metadata as well in the cleanup function to avoid\nleaking some extra memory.\n\nFix #19900",
